# The item buffer: fields, children and details, then comments loading 5 at a time as you scroll.
Output docs/demo/item.gif
Source scripts/demo/settings.tape

Hide
Type "ADO_DEMO_OPEN=1002 $NVIM -u scripts/demo/init.lua"
Enter
Sleep 1.5s
Show

Sleep 2s
Ctrl+D
Sleep 2.5s
Type "G"
Sleep 2.5s
Type "G"
Sleep 2.5s
